<div class="mandarin-hanzi">写</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">xiě</div>

''Meaning:'' write  
''Part of speech:'' verb

!! In context
学生在纸上写名字。 — Xuésheng zài zhǐ shang xiě míngzi. — The student writes a name on the paper.

!! Usage note
写 (xiě) takes written material as its object, as in 写字 (xiězì, 'write characters') or 写名字 (xiě míngzi, 'write a name').
